<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hanil Synthetic 1996 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Hanil Synthetic 1996 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			    99.2  vs    71.7</p>
<p>    Turnover			   585.0  vs   499.5</p>
<p>Note - Hanil Synthetic Fiber Co Ltd is the largest maker of acylic yarns in Korea.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
